  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper studies gate-based quantum optimization for multiple knapsack and risk-aware procurement problems using QAOA and QRAO on Qiskit AerSimulator. On 20 small MKP instances (~10 binary variables), QAOA achieved 63% optimal solutions with 0.092 average optimality gap, while QRAO with Magic rounding achieved 70% optimal solutions with 0.065 gap; on 10 larger procurement instances with at least 100 binary variables, QRAO with linear relaxation reported 80% feasibility and 0.053 optimality gap when 100% of variables were fixed.",
